<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>SpringBoot on QiYue's Blog</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/tags/springboot/</link><description>Recent content in SpringBoot on QiYue's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>&amp;copy; 2026 QiYue's Blog</copyright><lastBuildDate>Mon, 23 Aug 2021 23:19:53 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/tags/springboot/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>SpringBoot之Logback日志文件配置</title><link>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/springboot%E4%B9%8Blogback%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Aug 2021 23:19:53 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://hello-github-ui-github-io.onrender.com/posts/springboot%E4%B9%8Blogback%E6%97%A5%E5%BF%97%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/</guid><description>&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;概述&#10; &lt;div id="概述" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#%e6%a6%82%e8%bf%b0" aria-label="锚点"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Logback是一个日志框架，Logback和Log4j都是开源的日志工具库，Logback是Log4j的改良版本，内置实现了slf4j，比Log4j拥有更多的特性，性能也带来很大提升。SpringBoot默认内置了Logback日志框架，Spring Boot 集成logback需要添加 &lt;code&gt;spring-boot-starter-logging&lt;/code&gt; 依赖，而此依赖已经在 &lt;code&gt;spring-boot-starter&lt;/code&gt; 中添加过了，所以不用再添加此依赖了(如下图) ：&#10;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#10; class="my-0 rounded-md"&#10; loading="lazy"&#10; decoding="async"&#10; fetchpriority="low"&#10; alt="img"&#10; src="https://pic.imgdb.cn/item/6123ac4244eaada7399e7576.jpg"&#10; &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#10;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>